(2) Such application shall contain the following particulars

(a) a statement of the name and description of the ship ;

(b) a statement of the time when, and place where, the ship was built ; or, if the ship was foreign built, and the time and place of building are unknown, a statement to that effect, and of her foreign name ;

(c) a statement of the nature of the title to the said ship, whether by original construction by or for the Government or by purchase, caph.:re, condemnation or otherwise and a list of the docur.1ents of title, if any, in case she was not originally constructed by or for the Govern· ment of statutory body ; and ;

(d) a statement of the name of the master.

